---
description: Rules for the Spring modules
globs: ["spring/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Java 17 source level. No Lombok.
- `apiversa-core-java` depends only on Jackson and SnakeYAML Engine (safe loader). Spring is `provided`/`optional`.
- Conversion works on Jackson `JsonNode` trees. No reflection field access in the conversion path.
- One op per class in `io.github.kathanp.apiversa.ops`, one test class per op.
- Output for every conformance case must be byte-identical to the Node library (spec B7).
- Fast check: `cd spring && mvn -q -DskipITs test`.
